            "verseId": "JER.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.25.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 25.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore to lapa liopishana, nelotu Ishmael ilo ayioni le Netania, olayioni le Elishama, leilo marei le nkitoria, laa ninye obo loo lkituaak lo laiguanani, tenebo iltung'ana tomon enetii Gedalia olayioni le Ahikam, te Mispa. Ore enyaita ninche endaa tenebo teine te Mispa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedumunye Ishmael o lelo tung'ana tomon apa ootii tenebo ninye nedung to lalem Gedalia ilo ayioni le Ahikam olayioni le Shafan, near ninye metua, naa ninye apa etegelua olaiguanani le Babilon metaa olbalusui teina kop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nesesekuan sii Ishmael Ilyahudi pooki apa ootii tenebo Gedalia te Mispa, o sikarini loo Lkaldayo apa otii ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa teina olong te siadi esesekuanata e Gedalia, eton eitu eyiolou hoo ng'ae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebau iltung'ana ntomoni isiet ooing'uaa Shekem o Shilo o Samaria ebarno ilmunyo lenye nepolosa nkilani enye, nedung'udung'o iseseni lenye, eyau nkishoorot e nkurma o enkorropil pee eishooyo te nkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Ishmael olayioni le Netania te Mispa anang'are ninche, eishirita elotu. Ore enang'are ninche, nejoki ninche “Entijing'u wootu enetii Gedalia olayioni le Ahikam.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee epuonu ninche atua enkanasa, nesesekuan ninche Ishmael olayioni le Netania o lelo tung'ana ootii tenebo ninye, nenang'akini ninche atua engumoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etii apa iltung'ana tomon atua ninche ootiaakitia Ishmael, “Miar iyie iyiook matuatua, amu kiata ilchumat le nkano, o eilata, o enaisho oo lotorok eisudoro ti ong'ata.” Neaku etoning'o ninye neitu ear ninche metuata tenebo lelo apa le ncholuek enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa ina gumoto natanang'aka Ishmael impopoki e lelo tung'ana ootasesekuana naa engumoto sapuk apa naitobira olaiguanani Asa arripore ina kata egilunore olaiguanani oji Baasha le Israel; neigany Ishmael olayioni le Netania impopoki oo lootuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Ishmael araya lelo kulikae tung'ana apa ootii Mispa, ntoyie o laiguanani o ltung'ana pooki apa ootung'uayioki te Mispa ootung'ueikia Nebusaradan, olkitok le rripore Gedalia olayioni leAhikam. Neraya ninche Ishmael olayioni le Netania neboin ninche metalang'aki Ilamori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ake pee ening Yohanan olayioni le Karea o larikok pooki loo njorin tenebo ninye ina torroni pooki naataasa Ishmael olayioni le Netania. Nerik ninche ilewa lenye pooki nepuo aarare Ishmael olayioni le Netania, nepuonu ninche aainepu ninye to lchorro apa otii Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neriku ninche iltung'ana lenye pooki nepuo aarare Ishmael olayioni le Natania. Nerik ninche ilewa lenye pooki nepuo aarare Ishmael olayioni le Natania. Neinepu ninye to lchorro sapuk otii Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee edol iltung'ana pooki apa ootii tenebo Ishmael Yohanan olayioni le Karea o larikok pooki loo njorin tenebo ninye, neng'idayu ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore iltung'ana pooki apa ootaarayie Ishmael aitung'uaa Mispa neibelekenya aashukunye, nepuo enetii Yohanan olayioni le Karea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etuluayie Ishmael olayioni le Netania ailany Yohanan tenebo iltung'ana isiet, nelo atua Ilamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya Yohanan olayioni le Karea o larikok pooki loo njorin apa ootii tenebo ninye lelo tung'ana pooki apa ootarayie Ishmael olayioni le Netania aitung'uaa Mispa ina kata pee eidip atasesekuana Gedalia olayioni le Ahikam o sikarini, o nkituaak, o nkera, o sunaishi oo gelema apa ooyaua Yohanan ashuku te Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuo ninche, aatoni te Geruut Chimham te mbata e Betlehem, ejo pee epuo Misiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tenkaraki Ilkaldayo; amu keure apa ninche, enkaraki netasesekuana apa Ishmael olayioni le Netania Gedalia olayioni le Ahikam, laa ninye eitaa olaiguanani le Babilon olbalusui oitore ina kop.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
